  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You command the desert spirits to engulf your enemies in a swirling cloud of choking sand and dust. Anyone trapped within Sandstorm&rsquo;s radius, besides the caster, receives a -30 penalty to all Perception Tests, cannot see past 4 yards in front of them and cannot use missile weapons as the whirling sands make it impossible to aim and fire properly. For each +2 SL, the caster may make one ally immune to the effects of Sandstorm for the duration the spell is active.</p>"
